<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #222; line-height: 1.6;">

<p>{{greeting}}</p>

<p>I am {{sender_name}}, a {{degree}} student at {{college}} (graduating {{graduation_year}}). I am writing to inquire whether {{company}} offers internship opportunities in {{internship_interest}}.</p>

<p>My key skills include {{skills}}.{% if highlight_project %} {{highlight_project}}{% endif %}</p>

<p>I am genuinely interested in contributing to {{company}}&rsquo;s engineering work and learning from your team. I would be grateful to know if there are any open internship roles or the right process to apply through. I have attached my resume for your reference.</p>

{% if github or linkedin or portfolio %}
<p>You can find more of my work here:</p>
<ul>
  {% if linkedin %}<li><a href="{{linkedin}}">LinkedIn</a></li>{% endif %}
  {% if github %}<li><a href="{{github}}">GitHub</a></li>{% endif %}
  {% if portfolio %}<li><a href="{{portfolio}}">Portfolio</a></li>{% endif %}
</ul>
{% endif %}

<p>Thank you for your time, and I look forward to hearing from you.</p>

<p>
Warm regards,<br>
<strong>{{sender_name}}</strong><br>
{% if phone %}📞 {{phone}}<br>{% endif %}
{% if email %}✉️ {{email}}<br>{% endif %}
</p>

<hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin-top: 20px;">
<p style="font-size: 11px; color: #999;">If you'd prefer not to receive emails like this, just reply and I won't write again.</p>

</body>
</html>
